      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.91,
      "end_seconds": 10.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Well, uh, good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.3,
      "end_seconds": 15.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Alright, have you been here before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.77,
      "end_seconds": 19.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "A couple of times, but not recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.32,
      "end_seconds": 21.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "what's the the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.67,
      "end_seconds": 29.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "I'm here cos of sudden severe pain on the right side of my pelvis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.81,
      "end_seconds": 34.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.39,
      "end_seconds": 38.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "About... well, about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.09,
      "end_seconds": 47.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.64,
      "end_seconds": 70.17,
      "duration_seconds": 21.53,
      "text": "it just comes and goes yes, movement that makes it worse oh, and pain that comes in waves that's been about the same, two days okay, so with pain that comes in waves, about a six out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.81,
      "end_seconds": 74.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Alright, I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.48,
      "end_seconds": 89.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "that's it, just a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.0,
      "end_seconds": 110.27,
      "duration_seconds": 11.27,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 98 percent, pressure 112 over 84, weight 80 kilos, pulse 118, height 164 centimetres, BMI works out to 29.7."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.18,
      "end_seconds": 115.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.26,
      "end_seconds": 119.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.06,
      "end_seconds": 133.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "You are in severe pain with a tender mass low on the right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.89,
      "end_seconds": 140.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.39,
      "end_seconds": 160.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Any missed period or vaginal bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.74,
      "end_seconds": 165.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "No, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.07,
      "end_seconds": 168.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "any fever or discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.93,
      "end_seconds": 172.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "No fever or discharge, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.64,
      "end_seconds": 175.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
